  "releaseNotes": "MailKit 5.0 is a major release containing a number of breaking changes. See https://github.com/jstedfast/MailKit/blob/master/ReleaseNotes.md for the complete list of changes and https://github.com/jstedfast/MailKit/blob/master/PortingGuide.md for migration notes.\n\n* MailKit now depends on MimeKit.Core instead of MimeKit and no longer depends on BouncyCastle. S/MIME, OpenPGP, DKIM and ARC support requires the MimeKit.Cryptography package and a call to CryptographyModule.Initialize (). MailKitLite has been retired; use MailKit instead.\n* Send () and SendAsync () now return a SendResult (with AcceptedRecipients and RejectedRecipients) instead of a string. Per-message SMTP options such as DSN are now configured via SmtpSendRequest.\n* The ImapCapabilities, SmtpCapabilities and Pop3Capabilities flag enums have been replaced by read-only capability sets keyed by the ImapCapability, SmtpCapability and Pop3Capability enums.\n* Message sizes, folder sizes and quota limits are now 64-bit (long) values.\n* Added ImapIdleSession (via ImapClient.CreateIdleSession ()) to simplify monitoring a folder for changes.",
